    59	- `deadline_exceeded` records a transition observed by a live supervisor; it does not prove universal process death or external repair. Likewise `killpg`, CPU/RSS, and `RUSAGE_CHILDREN` must remain within their characterized evidence boundaries. [Task 1][Task 3]
